@page "/"

<PageTitle>FellowshipAnalyzer Design System</PageTitle>

<h1>FellowshipAnalyzer Design System</h1>
<p class="lede">
    A catalog of the UI components hero-module authors can compose to build report pages,
    guides, and statistics views. Each section below links to a showcase page with live
    demos and copyable Razor source.
</p>

<h2>How to read this catalog</h2>
<p>Every showcase uses <code>&lt;CodeExample&gt;</code>: the rendered demo sits on top, the toggleable source block sits below. Copy the snippet, paste into your hero project, swap in your analyzer data, ship.</p>

<h2>Primitives</h2>
<p>Generic UI building blocks. Use these for page chrome — they have no domain knowledge.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="tabs">Tabs</a> — underline, pill, and segmented tabbed navigation.</li>
    <li><a href="breadcrumbs">Breadcrumbs</a> — list-driven breadcrumb trail.</li>
    <li><a href="badge">Badge</a> — coloured pill rendered as span / button / link.</li>
    <li><a href="accordion">Accordion</a> — single- or multi-expand collapsible list.</li>
    <li><a href="button-group">ButtonGroup</a> — typed segmented single-select control.</li>
    <li><a href="avatar">Avatar</a> — image with letter fallback and accent ring.</li>
    <li><a href="page-header">PageHeader</a> — slot-based hero panel.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Icons &amp; spells</h2>
<p>Render hero portraits and the Fellowship Logs spell tooltips.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="hero-icon">HeroIcon</a> — strongly-typed hero portrait.</li>
    <li><a href="brand-icon">BrandIcon</a> — the FellowshipAnalyzer brand mark.</li>
    <li><a href="spell-icon">SpellIcon</a> — square spell icon with tooltip link.</li>
    <li><a href="spell-link">SpellLink</a> — inline link to a spell.</li>
    <li><a href="spell-value">SpellValue / SpellValueText / ValueText</a> — stat row primitives.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Statistics</h2>
<p>Containers used on the Statistics tab.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="statistics">Statistic / StatCard / StatTile / StatisticsSectionTitle</a></li>
    <li><a href="infrastructure">ReportLoadingScreen / ResourceGraph / SpiritStatistics / SpellTooltipProvider</a> — reference-only docs for runtime-bound components.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Guide layout</h2>
<p>Compose these around your analyzer's output to build the Guide tab.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="guide-layout">GuideContainer / Section / SubSection / GuideSection / SideBySidePanels</a></li>
    <li><a href="panels">RoundedPanel / PerformanceRoundedPanel</a></li>
    <li><a href="tip-box">TipBox / PerformanceTipBox</a></li>
    <li><a href="explanation">Explanation / HelperText / WipGuide</a></li>
    <li><a href="guide-data-wrapper">GuideDataWrapper</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>Performance</h2>
<p>Visualisations keyed to <code>PerformanceTier</code>.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="performance">PerformanceMark / PassFailCheckmark / PerfBadgeCount / PerfBadgeGrid</a></li>
    <li><a href="filter-badge">FilterBadge</a> — toggleable performance distribution badge.</li>
    <li><a href="bars">PassFailBar / GradiatedPerformanceBar / StackedBar / PerformanceBoxRow</a></li>
    <li><a href="spell-sequence">SpellSequence</a> — performance-coloured icon filmstrip.</li>
    <li><a href="cast">CastOverview / CastSummary / CastDetail</a> — high-level cast-quality views.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Timeline &amp; diagnostics</h2>
<p>Runtime-bound components, documented for reference.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="timeline">Timeline / CastBar / AuraBar / CooldownLane / TimeIndicators / TimelineSettingsModal</a></li>
    <li><a href="diagnostics">CopySpellDefinition / DebugAnnotationsView / EventsView</a></li>
</ul>
